  "body": "- Add Apple Silicon builds to release.\r\n- Support installing from Nix flake.\r\n- Add `-E/--exclude PATTERN` option to exclude paths from results.\r\n- Add `-e/--color WHEN` option to control colors in output.\r\n- The short flag for `--version` is renamed from `-v` to `-V`.\r\n- Provide completion scripts for various shells in scripts/completion.\r\n- Add `-p/--portable` option, which enables portable paths when generating editor aliases. Without this flag, editor alias only works in the same working directory in which `tre` was last invoked.\r\n- Files untracked by git is now included in output by default.\r\n- Output order is now deterministic.\r\n\r\n```\r\n4cf2a15652882886092c31dd2eab0d1368a9b08986e0bd043e63de0bc5fc75f3  tre-v0.4.0-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.gz\r\n5a356d1b677faac24b03a985b38c7f77b9ca3b5071b813054c2a36a48f4baceb  tre-v0.4.0-arm-unknown-linux-gnueabihf.tar.gz\r\nfcbdf70dc2e558ab6a2afc2a9035e4942814e5d14badbcde28b2e20eae1a028e  tre-v0.4.0-i686-pc-windows-msvc.zip\r\n43661bce1c93757918497d7bdbe365bd4f0621c932544adfa523457e525d3340  tre-v0.4.0-x86_64-apple-darwin.tar.gz\r\n7be50ba9ef68d6d39c430ae2b1fd0ad4127d8e3eb75be539679e6ffb21742ab8  tre-v0.4.0-x86_64-pc-windows-gnu.zip\r\n154ff87e848cefa8176e69cbf06318456cd782bc55bf067e18f385c226d268cf  tre-v0.4.1-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.msi\r\n9dfbf8c33038e6b31fb359d7f8e7661e46f015067f5cc2f378c93d8bbd1a432a  tre-v0.4.0-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.zip\r\n47b6b20db6cba7114628c024d00ca842ea9ea9eeb1678facd2468fe60b266bac  tre-v0.4.0-x86_64-unknown-linux-musl.tar.gz\r\n280243cfa837661f0c3fff41e4a63c6768631073c9f6ce9982d9ed08e038788a  v0.4.0.tar.gz\r\n7355ba2087b06de5ed4dc3266966d1eef9ac43c4b003745bce8167b8f2c90533  v0.4.0.zip\r\n```",
